  "alt": "An illustrative causal attention map, not measured data. Each row is a query and each column a key. The first column is the attention sink, the band along the diagonal is the immediate local context, and a few columns run the full height as heavy hitters that later tokens keep attending to.",
  "caption": "An illustration of the pattern, not observed attention data. Drop a heavy hitter and generation can destabilize.",
